WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.550
The year 563.

2
00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:06.570
A small boat leaves Ireland with
a monk and twelve companions,

3
00:00:06.620 --> 00:00:08.160
bound for Iona.

4
00:00:08.210 --> 00:00:12.950
At home, a man's rights, honour
and protection came from his kin.

5
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.570
Leaving them meant becoming nobody.

6
00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:19.260
Over the next centuries, many
Irish monks did the same.

7
00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:23.880
So why would a monk leave home
forever, with no plan to return?

8
00:00:23.930 --> 00:00:26.590
In this mission, you'll
follow six journeys,

9
00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.830
from Iona to Lake Constance and Würzburg.

10
00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:34.070
Then you'll weigh up an old debate:
were they saving their own souls,

11
00:00:34.120 --> 00:00:36.250
or setting out to win others?

12
00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:40.670
Your mission: find out why these
monks chose exile for life.
